    <item>
      <title>Virtual High School</title>
      <link>https://www.mattcarrier.com/archive/2007-01-07-virtual-high-school/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jan 2007 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.mattcarrier.com/archive/2007-01-07-virtual-high-school/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_zdYMSK7YuAA/SarwurLL63I/AAAAAAAAFJA/tjEh83DEpxQ/s1600-h/whs950015.jpg&#34; onblur=&#34;try {parent.deselectBloggerImageGracefully();} catch(e) {}&#34;&gt;&lt;img id=&#34;BLOGGER_PHOTO_ID_5308319795463842674&#34; style=&#34;margin: 0pt 10px 10px 0pt; float: left; cursor: pointer; width: 400px; height: 94px;&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; src=&#34;http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_zdYMSK7YuAA/SarwurLL63I/AAAAAAAAFJA/tjEh83DEpxQ/s400/whs950015.jpg&#34; border=&#34;0&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;The virtual high school or Windsor High school map was a project I did in my senior year for school. (2005) My goal was to create the whole school in a 3d environment which could be explored in the Half-Life 2 game engine. I figured the project would take between 80 and 100 hours. It ended up taking over 200 hours. This was a great learning experience for me. While it did end up taking me so long to do it, I enjoyed almost every minute of it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Virtual High School Install Guide</title>
      <link>https://www.mattcarrier.com/archive/2007-01-07-virtual-high-school-install-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jan 2007 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.mattcarrier.com/archive/2007-01-07-virtual-high-school-install-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;First you need Steam. &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.steampowered.com&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.steampowered.com&#34;&gt;http://www.steampowered.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;Then you need to either buy a copy of Half-Life 2 or The Orange Box to run the mod. This can be picked up retail for between 20 and 50 dollars. It can also be purchased directly from steam.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To install copy the &amp;ldquo;Virtual High School&amp;rdquo; folder (copy the folder that is in the same folder as the readme.txt file. Don&amp;rsquo;t copy the dated folder.) to your SourceMods folder in your steam directory.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
